    "body": "Antigravity (len) stopped before the claim. Issue #2227 depends on #2217.\n\nCurrent `upstream/main` (`380c29b3c`) has no `crates/gcode` directory. Its workspace `Cargo.toml` does not list `camcraft-gcode`.\n\n- Issue #2217 is open. Its latest comment records held work on `mkinney:issue/2217-camcraft-gcode` at `711314efd`, with `claimed` removed.\n- No open or closed PR exists on `NeoTech/Camcraft` for #2217 or `crates/gcode`.\n- Issue #2244 closed and PR #2263 merged on 2026-11-16, so #2217 can now resume.\n\nThere is no open PR for #2217 to stack on. This run works #2227 only and cannot implement #2217 or edit `Cargo.toml` dependencies.\n\nThis run made no claim, branch, worktree, code change, or test run. Suggestion: set `blocked` until #2217 opens a PR to stack on or merges to `main`. The maintainer decides.\n",
