    "body": "fix on issue/2227-klartext-reader · PR #4361 · pinned by klartext_post_golden_reads_back_into_the_stream_motion, klartext_cycle_200_pecks_from_the_surface_and_ends_at_the_2nd_clearance, klartext_functions_outside_the_slice_are_refused_by_name_and_block, klartext_seeded_mutations_of_the_golden_never_panic · merges at the next cut\n\nThis PR is a first slice (`Refs #2227`). These items stay open on this issue:\n- `CYCL DEF 206` / `207` (tapping).\n- `LBL` / `CALL LBL` subprogram calls.\n- `RND` / `CHF`, polar `LP` / `CP`, `APPR` / `DEP`.\n- Inch programs.\n- Radius compensation `RL` / `RR` (refused; the output is the tool-centre path).\nThe reader refuses each of them by name, with the line and the block number.",
